{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world of swords and magic, a city of many races, and you're a rookie owner who has inherited a tavern. There are tough roads ahead waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a 28-day deadline, you need to utilize everything at hand to make money. Each time you play you will meet different people, buy different equipment and experience different events. Utilizing their characteristics and matching them in the right combinations can help you find life from heavy debts, and even break through everyone's expectations to become a generation of tavern tycoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No need to manually set up the location, you can just load up the decorations and add to the popularity of the tavern to keep the customers coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/\u5bf9\u8bdd12.png?t=1744706437\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u82f1\u6587.png?t=1744706437\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/\u6d3b\u52a8\u82f1\u6587.png?t=1744706437\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Employees of different professions and ranks, each with distinctive skills, are the key to making the tavern thrive. The employees also have colorful lives and stories, and everyone deserves a deeper friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/\u7f29\u5c0f\u7acb\u7ed8\u4ecb\u7ecd.png?t=1744706437\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With hundreds of ingredients, dishes and drinks, you'll need to carefully organize your tavern's menu, and sometimes more recipes aren't better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/\u7f29\u5c0f\u9910\u996e\u4ecb\u7ecd.png?t=1744706437\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The store and guild system help you to get all kinds of equipments and props, and you can also organize activities to gain benefits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete tasks to earn extra rewards, and there are more mechanics hidden in the staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u82f1\u6587.png?t=1744706437\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/extras/\u6d3b\u52a8\u82f1\u6587.png?t=1744706437\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Baiying Tavern is as much about business as it is about life. Whatever you're looking for, it's worth a revisit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X\uff1a</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3100580?t=1744706437","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744706437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744706437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744706437","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world of swords and magic, a city of many races, and you're a rookie owner who has inherited a tavern. There are tough roads ahead waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a 28-day deadline, you need to utilize everything at hand to make money. Each time you play you will meet different people, buy different equipment and experience different events. Utilizing their characteristics and matching them in the right combinations can help you find life from heavy debts, and even break through everyone's expectations to become a generation of tavern tycoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No need to manually set up the location, you can just load up t